-### Point Cloud Voxelization via Discretization and Accumulation
-Converts a 3D point cloud into a binary voxel grid (occupancy grid) by discretizing coordinates and marking voxels as occupied if they contain at least one point [S6, unofficial]. It uses `accumarray` to count points per bin and thresholds the result, differing from centroid-based aggregation [S6, unofficial].
